      "content": "Compound A used as a strong oxidizing agent is amphoteric in nature. It is the part of lead storage batteries. Compound A is :",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "PbO"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "PbO<sub>2</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "PbSO<sub>4</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "Pb<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": "PbO<sub>2</sub> is strong oxidizing agent because Pb<sup>+4</sup> is\nnot stable and can be easily reduced to Pb<sup>+2</sup>.<br><br>\nPbO<sub>2</sub> is used in lead storage batteries. It is\nalso amphoteric in nature."
